  "R<color=#000000>a</color>diant Power": "",
  "H<color=#000000>o</color>ly Prayer": "",
  "T<color=#000000>o</color>wer Guide": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every 100 points of Fuuka's Attack, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\), and increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every 100 points of Fuuka's Attack, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\)\\. Lasts for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nGain 1 <link\\=\"s\\|267\"><u>Over Oracle</u></link> stack\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Your care for your allies becomes a dazzling light, raising their Attack\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every 100 points of Fuuka's Attack, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nIf the main target has a Theurgy, increase the Theurgy gauge by (\\d+)\\. Also, increase the target's Theurgy damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every 100 points of Fuuka's Attack, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nIf the main target has a Highlight, increase the Highlight gauge by (\\d+)%\\. Also, increase the target's Highlight damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every 100 points of Fuuka's Attack, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nThis skill's cooldown is calculated independently, and does not affect other support skills \\(the remaining cooldown is displayed in battle\\)\\.\\nInitial cooldown time: (\\d+) ally actions\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The radiance of a prayer overtakes all, increasing your allies' Attack\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(for every 1% of Fuuka's critical multiplier, increase by ([\\d\\.]+)% more, up to a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\. Also, gain 1 <link\\=\"s\\|267\"><u>Over Oracle</u></link> stack\\.\\nIf allies meet special conditions, activate 1 of the following effects based on the order listed \\(if conditions are not met, activate 1 effect at random\\)\\.\\n1\\. If allies are inflicted with spiritual ailments, remove 1 ailment from the target \\(incurable ailments count for the condition, but they cannot be removed\\)\\.\\n2\\. If allies' HP is below (\\d+)%, restore (\\d+)% of max HP to the ally with the lowest remaining HP percentage\\.\\n3\\. If allies have less than (\\d+) SP, restore (\\d+) SP to the ally with the lowest SP\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>The power of your will envelops your allies, boosting their critical damage\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's stats by ([\\d\\.]+)% of Fuuka's stats\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^When an ally activates a Highlight or Theurgy, increase party's critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^At the start of battle, increase party's stats based on <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of the <link\\=\"s\\|270\"><u>Shift Member</u></link>'s stats\\.$\"": "",
  "At the party selection screen, Fuuka can set 1 ally as a <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>Shift Member</u></link>, and during battle she can use Oracle Shift to swap in the Shift Member. Oracle Shift can be activated 1 time per <link\\=\"s|269\"><u>round</u></link> by spending 4 <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>Over Oracle</u></link> stacks.\\nAt the start of battle, gain 1/2/3 Over Oracle stacks (at level 1/50/70, respectively), up to a maximum of 4 stacks.\\nOracle Shift: Temporarily swap the currently acting ally with the Shift Member, allowing them to take 1 action. At this time, replicate buff and debuff effects granted to the swapped-out target, excluding effects granted by the target and certain special effects (replicated effects are active only during the swap). When the Shift Member first swaps, activate all start-of-battle effects, and then reduce skill cooldown times as usual based on the number of rounds. After the Shift Member's action, they swap back with the target, who can continue acting. However, support skill cooldown times and the swapped-out target's buff and debuff effect turn counters are not decreased from the Shift Member's action.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 2 more <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>Over Oracle</u></link> stacks. Also, increase the maximum number of stacks to 8.\\nWhen Fuuka uses a skill, increase party's critical rate by 6% and critical damage by 15% for 2 turns. Stacks up to 2 times.": "",
  "When swapping in a <link\\=\"s|270\"><u>Shift Member</u></link> with <link\\=\"s|268\"><u>Oracle Shift</u></link>, activate the target's Highlight or Theurgy (this effect can activate 1 time every 3 <link\\=\"s|269\"><u>rounds</u></link>).\\nAfter activating Oracle Shift, increase party's <link\\=\"s|236\"><u>final damage amplification</u></link> by 10% for 1 turn.\\nWhen an ally's HP falls below 40% of the maximum, restore 20% of their max HP, and also restore 15% of max HP every turn for 2 turns. This effect activates once per battle.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Divine Prayer and Thoughtful Waves by 3.": "",
  "When an ally activates a Highlight or Theurgy, increase its damage by 25%.": "",
  "Increase the skill level of Luminous Force by 3.": "",
  "The number of <link\\=\"s|267\"><u>Over Oracle</u></link> stacks spent when activating <link\\=\"s|268\"><u>Oracle Shift</u></link> becomes 3.\\nWhen activating Divine Prayer, gain 2 Over Oracle stacks.\\nThe duration of the final damage amplification effect of Pros and Cons becomes 2 turns and stacks up to 2 times.": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's Atk ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\. Increase dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nGain 1 Over Oracle\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Spend (\\d+) Over Oracle to temporarily swap currently acting ally with Shift Member, allowing them to take (\\d+) action\\. At this time, replicate buff and debuff effects granted to swapped-out target, excluding effects granted by target and certain special effects \\(replicated effects are active only during the swap\\)\\. When Shift Member first swaps, activate all start-of-battle effects\\. After Shift Member's action, they swap back with target, who can continue acting\\. However, support skill cooldown times and swapped-out target's buff and debuff effect turn counters are not decreased from Shift Member's action\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's Atk ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\);\\nIf main target has Theurgy, increase Theurgy gauge by (\\d+)\\. Also, increase target's Theurgy dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\);\\nIf main target has Highlight, increase Highlight gauge by (\\d+)%\\. Also, increase target's Highlight dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\);\\nThis skill's cooldown is calculated independently, and does not affect other support skills \\.;\\nInitial cooldown time: (\\d+) ally actions$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's crit dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 1% of Fuuka's crit mult \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\. Also, gain 1 Over Oracle\\.\\nIf allies meet special conditions, activate 1 of the following effects based on order listed \\(if conditions aren't met, activate 1 effect at random\\)\\.\\n1\\. If allies have spiritual ailments, remove 1 ailment from target \\(incurable ailments count for condition, but cannot be removed\\)\\.\\n2\\. If allies' HP is below (\\d+)%, restore (\\d+)% of max HP to ally with lowest remaining HP percentage\\.\\n3\\. If allies have less than (\\d+) SP, restore (\\d+) SP to ally with lowest SP\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's Atk ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nIf main target has Theurgy, increase Theurgy gauge by (\\d+)\\. Also, increase target's Theurgy dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nIf main target has Highlight, increase Highlight gauge by (\\d+)%\\. Also, increase target's Highlight dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per 100 of Fuuka's Atk \\(max ([\\d\\.]+)%, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nThis skill's cooldown is calculated independently, and does not affect other support skills \\.\\nInitial cooldown time: (\\d+) ally actions$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Can spend (\\d+) stacks to use Oracle Shift\\.$\"": ""
